Proof.
  intros E cs R FULL model a n HC Hin. destruct (hb_kn E cs R FULL model _ HC Hin) as [Hf Hz].
  split; [exact Hf|]. intros i Hi. exact (hb_mr_some E cs model FULL _ _ (Hz i Hi)).
Qed.

